{"unit_id":"miaomiao636__dsh-message-navigator#feature-1","repo":"miaomiao636/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"ac80f894dcf6d97b86e35c509193b361dda01b8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-message-navigator 的功能「用户消息刻度」：为普通用户发言和 steering 插话生成紧凑刻度，并排除 AI 等非用户消息。通过 DSH Web 会话页面的消息 DOM 自动更新，不需要额外命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/dom.ts:78-88"]}
